  m_text: 'For some profoundly disturbing and inexplicable reason, events have taken
    a bad turn and you have been imprisoned by Professor Moriarty (your arch-nemesis)''s
    crony Colonel Sebastian Moran. Look around the room and find a way to escape.
    Oh, and be sure to keep your eyes open for his guards, who emerge from the HQ
    at 16 seconds. They will inevitably attack you and you have to fend for yourself.
    ''E'' to punch and ''Q'' to kick.

'
