  m_text: Go, Holmes, go. The only reason I let you escape instead of starve here
    and die is because I want to kill you myself. I want to twist your overthinking
    little head off that dares to challenge me. How long did it take you to escape?
    A long time, I'd wager. You might have escaped from one trap, but you'll walk
    straight into another. Anyways, I'll let you figure out how to get out of here
    yourself. See you at the falls.
